      "message": "I have no opinion here. We usually use CPRINTF/CPRINTS. Here it is just that we need 2 cprints channels, so extra letter. It might be that it is worth to split this file into parts related to TPM regs, TPM task and other stuff. We use `cprints(CC_TASK` explicitly in the code. I\u0027d leave it for later cleanup.",
