      "writtenOn": "2023-12-21T18:29:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This file prints to 3 channels. Normally we only print to one channel. I think it\u0027s useful to add the letter that describes the channel, so you can tell where it\u0027s printing to and how verbose the channel is.",
