        "id": 1136059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-21T15:25:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this safe to do?\n\nEven if it is safe to do. I think it\u0027ll be too much output. If you turn on the tpm channel on a real device there is too much tpm output and it becomes garbled. If we add more data, it\u0027ll worsen the issue.",
