        "id": 1324172
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-21T17:00:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "it is a TPM2 header - it doesn\u0027t have anything secret. 4 bytes are command code, 4 bytes are size, 2 - session tag if any, 2 - subcommand\n\nIn response it is the same, but includes response code, which can be useful.",
      "parentUuid": "9dc2aa18_af4e9b19",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1053,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 1053,
